  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance (TA) to governments of KP &amp; Federal.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">E4H will focus on embedded technical assistance in the provincial governments of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (KP), with support provided to the Federal government as well. E4H will likely operate as an important part of a wider UK-Pakistan Health Partnership Agreement. BHC Islamabad&#x2019;s 
experience to date has demonstrated that this approach to TA is one of the most effective ways to deliver against intended outcomes, facilitating domestic ownership and leadership, essential for sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
